flowchart TD
  H["Target model's hidden features<br/>(low, middle and high layers)"] --> D["EAGLE-3 draft head<br/>one light layer"]
  D --> TREE["Draft tree of candidate tokens"]
  TREE --> V["Target verifies the tree<br/>in one forward pass (tree attention)"]
  V --> ACC["Accept the longest valid path<br/>(rejection rule keeps the distribution)"]
  ACC --> KV["Roll back the KV cache<br/>for rejected branches"]
  KV --> H
